<title>USA: West Marine Inc Sept same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>West Marine Inc Sept same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>WATSONVILLE, Calif. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$30.9	$19.0    + 62.8	+ 3.7</p>
<p>Quarter	   $104.5	$60.3    + 73.5	+ 6.2</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $254.0     $178.6    + 42.2	+ 5.6</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   five weeks ended Sept. 28, 1996.</p>
<p>West Marine acquired E&amp;B Marine on June 17, 1996.</p>
</text>
